  "supplementalCaptureNotes": [
    "2026-10-07: Eight pending README image assets captured from the shipped integrated release. Earlier 2026-10-02 capture notes apply only to those earlier entries. README left hand-maintained and unchanged.",
    "Light application UI with Tomorrow Night viewport; 1283x820 windows, except contextual-insertion.png at 1721x1393 to show the complete panel. Demo models are retained under models/. Models using enclosure-cutaway.scad depend on that adjacent helper file.",
    "openscad-skill.png remains pending: requested scene is an agent reviewing annotations; computer-use guidance prohibits automating ChatGPT desktop/Codex interfaces. No substitute or fabricated agent UI was created.",
    "Observed issue: selecting attachment lid_mount reports Named reference is missing: lid_mount, while the same model correctly evaluates the attachment placement. Selecting anchor rim resolves and displays its frame; this is the captured state.",
    "README cross-section description still mentions graphical handles/rotation that the current UI no longer exposes. Capture shows current position and direction controls, without changing user-maintained prose.",
    "At 820 px window height, Inspector and insertion parameter areas clip some controls. The insertion screenshot uses a taller window. Opening the insertion dock alone does not start an insertion; use Design > Add (Shift+A), pick the surface, then choose the item."
  ]
